  "description": "Modern Living in the Cavco Pegasus - Flexible, Stylish, and Energy-Efficient\n\nStep into the Cavco Pegasus, a beautifully designed manufactured home available in a range of floor plans-from a cozy 3-bed, 2-bath layout at approx. 1,128 sq ft to a spacious 4-bed, 2-bath design offering nearly 1,800 sq ft. Perfect for growing families or downsizers who don't want to sacrifice comfort, the Pegasus features an open-concept living space that flows into a modern, well-appointed kitchen.\n\nEnjoy features like 42\" cabinetry, full tile backsplash, stainless steel appliances, and a walk-in pantry with sliding barn door. The primary suite is tucked away for privacy and includes a large walk-in closet, double-sink vanity, and optional soaker tub or shower. Each layout maximizes function without wasted space.\n\nAdditional highlights include finished drywall, recessed LED lighting, Low-E windows, upgraded insulation, and energy-efficient construction throughout. Durable linoleum flooring, ceiling fans, and add style and comfort. Whether you're looking for smart design, low maintenance, or modern features, the Pegasus delivers.\n\nDon't miss this opportunity to own a thoughtfully crafted home that blends value with versatility. Schedule your showing today!",
